---

<BaseLayout title="全平台纯净版网络代理客户端极速下载 | 资源库 - ClashWiki" description="还在四处寻找各平台最新客户端安装包？ClashWiki 官方直链提供 Windows/Mac/iOS/Android 全生态纯净网络代理工具，点击即可安全无毒极速下载。" keywords="客户端下载,纯净版资源,官方直链,全生态支持" >
  <div class="fixed inset-0 z-[-1] pointer-events-none overflow-hidden bg-slate-800">
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[40vw] h-[40vw] rounded-full bg-indigo-500/5 blur-[120px] mix-blend-multiply"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pt-28 pb-24 relative z-10">
    <BackButton text="返回博客" href="/blog/" />
    <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: '博客', href: '/blog/' }, { label: '软件下载' }]} />
    
    <div class="mt-8 mb-4">
      <CategoryNav activeCategory="软件下载" />
    </div>
    
    <div class="mt-8 mb-16 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-100 mb-6 tracking-tight">
        全平台客户端 <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 to-fuchsia-500">下载中心</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        为您整理了 Windows、macOS、iOS 和 Android 各大平台的最新主流代理客户端，安全无毒，直达官方下载。
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-16">
      {platforms.map(platform => (
        <section class="scroll-mt-24" id={platform.id}>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-8">
            <div class={`w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br ${platform.color} flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-lg`}>
              <Fragment set:html={platform.icon} />
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-200 m-0">{platform.name} 端下载</h2>
          </div>
          
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            {platform.apps.map(app => (
              <div class="bg-slate-900/80 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-slate-700/60 shadow-xl shadow-slate-900/50/40 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-slate-900/50 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col h-full">
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                    <div class={`w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl ${app.iconColor} flex items-center justify-center shrink-0`}>
                      <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4" /></svg>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-200 m-0 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">{app.name}</h3>
                      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-400 mt-1">{app.price}</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <span class={`px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-white rounded-lg ${app.badgeColor} shadow-sm shrink-0`}>
                    {app.badge}
                  </span>
                </div>
                
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8 flex-1">
                  {app.desc}
                </p>
                
                <a href={app.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-auto block w-full py-3 px-4 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-indigo-600 text-white text-center font-bold rounded-xl shadow-lg transition-colors duration-300">
                  前往下载 ➔
                </a>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </section>
      ))}
    </div>
    
    <!-- 提示框 -->
    <div class="mt-20 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl p-8 flex gap-6 items-start">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-600 shrink-0">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" /></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-900 mb-2">安全下载提示</h3>
        <p class="text-amber-800/80 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-0">
          为了保障您的设备安全，我们提供的所有下载链接均指向官方 GitHub 仓库或苹果 App Store。<br/>
          <strong>请不要轻信网络上来源不明的第三方安装包</strong>，以免下载到被植入后门或木马的恶意软件。对于需要外区 Apple ID 下载的 iOS 软件，建议您注册一个美区账号进行购买。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <HubFooterLinks />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
